Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episod}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.36,0:00:06.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tsuda!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:08.15,0:00:13.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc pentru ajutorul de zilele trecute. \NDatorită ție, nu am rămas în urmă cu proiectul.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.41,0:00:17.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi cer scuze pentru \Ncă ți-am răpit din timp!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.25,0:00:18.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ito,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.71,0:00:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,suntem în aceeași echipă. \NTrebuie să ne ajutăm reciproc.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.33,0:00:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If anything,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.21,0:00:26.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd rather hear a simple "thank you."
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.38,0:00:29.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tsuda!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.01,0:00:29.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Imediat!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.68,0:00:32.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc foarte mult!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.39,0:00:35.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai câteva minute să discutăm despre prezentarea de mâine?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.35,0:00:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Desigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.73,0:00:42.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, as for features we can add to the language area...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.61,0:00:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lucrez pentru un mare \Nproducător de electronice,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.32,0:00:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}în departamentul de planificare \Npentru roboți casnici cu IA,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:47.90,0:00:49.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ceea ce mă ține ocupată în fiecare zi.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.70,0:00:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun, gata cu munca.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.70,0:00:57.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oricum, ce naiba e așa \Ngrozav la realitatea virtuală?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.75,0:01:02.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, liderul departamentului a spus că \Ninteligența artificială nu-mi va lua locul de muncă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.88,0:01:04.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar nu știe acest lucru cu certitudine!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:05.30,0:01:08.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar dacă voi fi înlocuită de un robot \Ncu IA și nu mă mai angajează nimeni?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.72,0:01:12.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi muri de una singură în \Nacest apartament dezordonat.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:14.35,0:01:16.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu! Îmi voi angaja o menajeră drăguță!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.35,0:01:19.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un robot-menajeră multifuncțional? Nu! Un robot-menajeră de cafenea? Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:20.35,0:01:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uau, chiar au lăsat ceva atât \Nde mare nesupravegheat?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.35,0:01:25.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, e așa de grea!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.40,0:01:29.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai, ar fi trebuit să deschid \Nușa mai întâi! La naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:30.70,0:01:31.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stăpână?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:32.20,0:01:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stăpână, e timpul să te trezești.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.45,0:01:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bună dimineața, stăpână.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.41,0:01:42.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai dormit bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.37,0:01:46.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine ești? De unde ai apărut?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Din cutia de la ușă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.71,0:01:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acea cutie imensă?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.67,0:01:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am cumpărat cumva o fată reală?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.13,0:01:54.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici vorbă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.64,0:01:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Privește, aici este portul meu de încărcare.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.68,0:02:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt un android cu trăsături \Nfeminine, conceput pentru sex.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.39,0:02:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Numele meu este Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.60,0:02:07.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta sună mult prea ciudat! \NSigur {\i1}este{\i0} ilegal!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.15,0:02:09.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Voi fi arestată, băgată la închisoare și îmi voi pierde locul de muncă...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.73,0:02:10.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gata, gata.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.74,0:02:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, just touch me as I give you the user tutorial.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.24,0:02:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt așa de moi.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.66,0:02:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was built with the "idealized human form" in mind,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:19.79,0:02:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,equipped with finely tuned pressure sensors
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.04,0:02:25.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that respond to even the faintest stimula—
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You felt that?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.84,0:02:28.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.50,0:02:33.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not even my company \Nhas humanoid robots this elaborate.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.13,0:02:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stăpână?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.85,0:02:39.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce ai făcut asta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.22,0:02:42.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te holbai la buzele mele, \Ndeci am crezut că dorești un sărut.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.52,0:02:44.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar mă gândeam!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.48,0:02:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was it unsatisfactory?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.69,0:02:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am certain that my oral cavity's specs are fine, so...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:52.11,0:02:53.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about my genitalia?{alt: "entry port" to be more like the previous "oral cavity"?}
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.74,0:02:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's downright incredible.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.57,0:03:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you insert your finger, \NI can officially register you as my master.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.99,0:03:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.66,0:03:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. Then you're a bottom, Master.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:06.33,0:03:08.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't take everything I say as horny!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.38,0:03:10.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.71,0:03:14.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can conduct the registration another time.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.38,0:03:17.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lastly, we'll perform \Na direct demonstration of my body.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.14,0:03:22.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Relaxează-te și lasă totul în seama mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! Where are you putting that finger?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.14,0:03:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:28.27,0:03:32.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I assure you I'll guide you to ecstasy.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.44,0:03:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My tongue and fingertips have multiple sensors
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.32,0:03:38.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,capable of detecting your erogenous zones.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's one.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.08,0:03:46.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, I compile detailed \Nreports during sexual activity,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.75,0:03:51.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so that the quality of our sexual \Nexperience will improve with each session.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.54,0:03:52.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So does that mean
Dialogue: 99,0:03:53.96,0:03:55.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}this girl is going to have a record
Dialogue: 99,0:03:55.97,0:03:58.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}of all my most embarrassing spots?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just activated my finger's vibrate function.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.40,0:04:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By smoothly modulating the strength \Nand direction of the vibration,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:10.86,0:04:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}E prima oară când fac asta cu o altă fată,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.52,0:04:16.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we can maximize your pleasure.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.52,0:04:15.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}dar se simte așa de bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.61,0:04:17.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Nu mă pot opri! Oh, nu...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.24,0:04:28.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing you had the day off from work.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.21,0:04:29.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.92,0:04:33.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was able to tend to you all day long, Master.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.46,0:04:36.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cred că s-a zis cu viața mea.
